A production-grade lightweight microservice and single-page web interface built with FastAPI, Vanilla JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS.

## Architecture Summary

- **Backend**: FastAPI microservice serving API endpoints and static assets.
- **Frontend**: Lightweight SPA built with HTML5, Vanilla JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS.
- **Security**: Strict non-wildcard CORS handling, XSS protection using safe DOM text manipulation APIs, explicit HTTP routing, and clean environment management.

## API Routes

| Method | Route | Description | Response Schema |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/health` | System health indicator | `{"status": "ok"}` |
| GET | `/api/random` | Generates integer N (1 <= N <= 100) | `{"number": 42}` |

